## What this approval does NOT cover

- **`PREREG_CUBE_v1.md`** (`30371fc3bbc47c9b…`) is **NOT approved**. It is committed unmodified for
  lineage only. It predates the 2026-08-13 fullpop incident and omits eight of the fourteen required
  provisions. It must never be cited as the governing contract.
- **No release of held cells.** `B21_FINAL_S101/S202/S303`, `B22B_DRIFT_SCORE`, `B23_SEALED_READ`,
  `B24_COHORT_RANKING_READ` and `B24B_SHAP` remain `# HELD-OWNER-SELECTION` and require a separate,
  explicit owner release following validation (§14).
- **No re-entry to cube fitting.** All seven re-entry criteria in §15 remain open. Approval of the
  contract is not satisfaction of the contract.
- **No canonical adoption of acquired data.** §13 authorises acquisition and forensic
  reconciliation only. `test_item_202412.csv` remains quarantined forensic evidence; neither the
  DfT nor the DVSA 2023 release becomes authoritative by virtue of this approval.

